cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Catalogue of Catalogues: A Web Platform for Earthquake Catalogue Management, Merging, and Statistical Analysis"
abstract: >-
  A browser-native, FAIR-oriented web platform for integrating, merging,
  quality-scoring, and statistically analysing earthquake catalogues from
  multiple agencies and formats.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/KennyGraham1/catalogofcatalogs"
url: "https://catalogofcatalogs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/"
keywords:
  - earthquake catalogue
  - seismicity
  - catalogue merging
  - FAIR data
  - QuakeML
  - Aotearoa New Zealand
